      "description": "stemflow is a toolkit for Adaptive Spatio-Temporal Model (AdaSTEM) in python.\nA typical usage is daily abundance estimation using eBird citizen science data.\nIt leverages the \"adjacency\" information of surrounding target values in space and time,\nto predict the classes/continuous values of target spatial-temporal points.\n",
      "dev_url": "https://github.com/chenyangkang/stemflow",
      "doc_url": "https://chenyangkang.github.io/stemflow/",
      "home": "https://github.com/chenyangkang/stemflow",
      "license": "MIT",
